Recommends: speech-dispatcher, tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-tur
Description: Head tracking and Turkish voice control accessibility suite
 Pardus Erişim lets users control the computer without mouse or
 keyboard: a webcam tracks head pose and maps it to the cursor
 (dwell or a half-second eye-close to click, with corner magnetism),
 and Turkish voice commands are resolved offline (Whisper, with a
 lightweight Vosk fallback). Automatic read-aloud speaks on-screen
 text under the pointer, and an optional Gemini-backed assistant
 answers questions and turns free speech into multi-step actions.
 .
 Developed for the TEKNOFEST Pardus operating system category.
